# Windows writes an NTFS alternate data stream next to anything downloaded from
# the internet. Copied out through WSL it becomes a real file named
# "logo.svg:Zone.Identifier". Four of them were committed with the funder logos,
# and a colon is illegal in a GitHub Actions artifact path, so the build stayed
# red at the upload step even though Jekyll itself succeeded.
*:Zone.Identifier

# Jekyll
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.jekyll-metadata
Gemfile.ci
Gemfile.ci.lock
vendor/

# tools/check_links.py writes its report here; Python caches next to the script
link-report.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc
